    "title": "Dataset for \"A Computational Search for Minimal Obstruction Graphs for the Lovász-Schrijver SDP Hierarchy\"",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15483991",
    "publication_date": "2025-05-30",
    "description": "<div>This dataset contains supporting materials for our research manuscript \"A Computational Search for Minimal Obstruction Graphs for the Lov&aacute;sz-Schrijver SDP Hierarchy\". Below you'll find the following files:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LS_+ certificate packages.zip</strong>, <strong>LS_+^2 certificate packages.zip</strong>, and <strong>LS_+^3 certificate packages.zip</strong> respectively contains all LS_+, LS_+^2, and LS_+^3 certificate packages mentioned in the manuscript.</li>\n<li><strong>Code.zip</strong> contains MATLAB code for verifying all LS_+, LS_+^2, and LS_+^3 certificate packages in this dataset.</li>\n<li><strong>List of 4-minimal graphs.zip</strong> contains a list of the 4107 4-minimal graphs we discovered, in graph6 format.</li>\n<li><strong>Tables of graphs.zip</strong> contains lists of graphs mentioned in Figure 8 and Tables 1, 2, and 3 in the manuscript, in graph6 format.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>Each of the above zipped folders also contains a readme.txt file which provides more details about the contents of that folder.</div>",
